answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "5\\,j"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037455/state.json" "file_sha256" "f945047955e33b6065b36bf5537f6934c9065f79a354f7c7f7118ad50c801644" "basis" 1268 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037455/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-348690" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Given that $r(t)=⟨cos\\,(\\frac{\\pi t}{2}),\\,\\sqrt{{t}^{3}-4},\\,ln\\,(2\\,{e}^{t-2}-1)⟩,$ what is $|r(2)|?$ Do not round the answer.\n\n$|r(2)|=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037455/state.json" "file_sha256" "f945047955e33b6065b36bf5537f6934c9065f79a354f7c7f7118ad50c801644" "basis" 1268 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037455/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-348690" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Evaluating the function at $t=2,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(2) & =⟨cos\\,(\\frac{2\\pi }{2}),\\,\\sqrt{{2}^{3}-4},\\,ln\\,(2\\,{e}^{0}-1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi ),\\,\\sqrt{4},\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡(1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,2,\\,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the magnitude of this vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r(2)| & =\\sqrt{(-1)^{2}+{2}^{2}+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1+4+0} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037455/state.json" "file_sha256" "f945047955e33b6065b36bf5537f6934c9065f79a354f7c7f7118ad50c801644" "basis" 1268 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037455/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-348690" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037455/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "64c68ca974ad10c77d63faf7ee266208d4c766b30c27e9d04d0fc12a5d19bb3a" "basis" 1268 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037455/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-348690" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037455/state.json" "file_sha256" "f945047955e33b6065b36bf5537f6934c9065f79a354f7c7f7118ad50c801644" "basis" 1268 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14037455/edb-import/verification.json"}] "sources" [{"question" "q-123285" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $|r(3)|$ given that $r(t)=⟨2t-4,\\,\\sqrt{6t+7},\\,\\sqrt{t+4}⟩.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14069696/state.json" "file_sha256" "bd788fb6f448baded22810c4867a26897807d5fbfe897330a049f4b58ca147a8"} {"question" "q-123285" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Evaluating the function at $t=3,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r(3) & =⟨2(3)-4,\\,\\sqrt{6(3)+7},\\,\\sqrt{3+4}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,5,\\,\\sqrt{7}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing the magnitude of this vector, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r(3)| & =\\sqrt{{(2)}^{2}+{(5)}^{2}+(\\sqrt{7})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4+25+7} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{36} \\\\  & =6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14069696/state.json" "file_sha256" "bd788fb6f448ba